      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LAYTON MAGIC (2) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 2.25 lengths at this track in a handy 24.47 beating TAW MYSTIQUE. Ran the fastest time on the program in his latest win. Can measure up again. SILENT ACCORD (1) turned in a plain run last time when fifth at this track over 350m behind Nangar Jim (20.40) in a Mix 2/3. Goes well out of this box with a win and four minor placings. Should be in this for a long way. TIN ROOF RUSTY (3) has a strong record here with seven wins and four placings from 18 starts. Missed the frame latest (26.31) when eighth over 457m at Temora in a NG. Looks suited here and can measure up. TAW MYSTIQUE (4) is one of the chances after collecting a minor prize last time.",
